# Personal Gmail: SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com, SMTP_PORT=587, SMTP_ENABLE_SSL=true, SMTP_USERNAME=<your Gmail>,
# SMTP_PASSWORD=<16-character App Password, not your Gmail password>, SMTP_FROM=<same Gmail>. See db/EMAIL.md.
